.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm mbt_tracker_server
module provides the backend infrastructure for running BitTorrent tracker services, including a shared peer store and both UDP and HTTP server implementations.
.Sh PEER STORE
The
.Vt mbt_tracker_store
manages the shared database of active torrents and peers. It is used by both the UDP and HTTP servers to persist session information.
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_store_new
Creates a new peer store. If the provided pointer is NULL, an internal store is created.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_store_free
Destroys the store and frees all associated resources.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_store_num_torrents
Returns the number of active torrents in the store.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_store_num_peers
Returns the total number of peers across all torrents.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_store_stats
Populates a
.Vt mbt_tracker_stats
structure with current counts for torrents, peers, seeders, and leechers.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_store_gc
Performs garbage collection by expiring stale peers (those inactive for >30 minutes) and removing empty torrent entries.
.El
.Sh UDP TRACKER SERVER
The UDP implementation handles BEP 15 announced requests.
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_server_new
Initializes a new UDP tracker server on the specified port, using the provided event loop and peer store.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_server_free
Destroys the UDP tracker server instance.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_server_port
Returns the port number the server is listening on.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_server_num_torrents
Returns the number of torrents currently known by this server instance.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_server_num_peers
Returns the number of peers currently known by this server instance.
.El
.Sh HTTP TRACKER SERVER
The HTTP implementation handles BEP 3 announced requests. This implementation relies on a user-provided HTTP callback function for transport.
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_http_free
Destroys the HTTP tracker server instance.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_http_new
Initializes a new HTTP tracker server on the specified port, using the provided event loop and peer store.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_http_num_torrents
Returns the number of torrents known by this HTTP server instance.
.El
.Bl -tag -width 12
.It .Fn mbt_tracker_http_num_peers
Returns the number of peers known by this HTTP server instance.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt 3
